    "z1": 6885
   },
   "text": "The keeper's log.\n23 JULY. 1610. The estate gardener came up for supplies again. Said the dogs have got out.\n0305. Woman from the lot, bitten by a dog. Bad. Phone's dead. Bandaged her, sent her up in 4 to Hal. He's got the radio.\n0340. Something at the window."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 8755,
    "z0": 5865,
    "x1": 9520,
    "z1": 6885
   },
   "text": "A kettle on the hotplate. Stone cold."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 3060,
    "z0": 3400,
    "x1": 6800,
    "z1": 4420
   },
   "text": "Blood all over the counter. This is where he bandaged her.\nThe first aid cabinet's been emptied."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 1700,
    "z0": 2210,
    "x1": 2890,
    "z1": 3910
   },
   "text": "The window's been smashed in from outside. Something came through here."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 8500,
    "z0": 2550,
    "x1": 9520,
    "z1": 4590
   },
   "text": "The keeper. They dragged him into the machine room.\nThe wheel's stopped."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 1700,
    "z0": 1700,
    "x1": 3060,
    "z1": 2550
   },
   "text": "Keys on a board. SHED. GATE. PUMP. One hook's empty: DRIVE."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 8670,
    "z0": 5440,
    "x1": 9520,
    "z1": 6630
   },
   "text": "His coat's still on the hook. He never left."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 5440,
    "z0": 7650,
    "x1": 6800,
    "z1": 8500
   },
   "text": "ARKLAY SKYWAY, 1996. Built with the support of the Umbrella Corporation.\nUmbrella. Again."
  },
